# Build context of the demo images (oec/demos/*/Dockerfile, C-084), of
# the registry image (oec/registry/Dockerfile, C-090) and of the tool image
# (oec/conformance/Dockerfile, C-107): only what the builds need; no build
# output, no generated keys or storages, no node_modules.
*
!schema
!sdk/rust
!sdk/go
!demos
# the tool image: D7/D8 and the spec data they embed
!conformance
!spec
# the registry: its crate, the API documents it embeds, the reviewed and
# stamped Web UI bundle it embeds and the lockfile of that bundle (SBOM)
!registry/Cargo.toml
!registry/Cargo.lock
!registry/src
!registry/api/openapi.json
!registry/api/asyncapi.json
!registry/ui/dist
!registry/ui/package-lock.json
schema/tools
spec/tools
sdk/rust/spike
sdk/go/lib
**/target
**/node_modules
**/.DS_Store
